From 3e5a1563e973318f29d5d05172479055bcaede74 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Illescas Romero <illescas.daniel@protonmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 11:44:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 45/65] P6: sprint+crouch tactical slide with
 fire-while-sliding.

Linear decay slide (boost/steer/cooldown), crouch hand-off, jump cancel,
camera roll/FOV/gun dip; ADS blocked by default; AI unchanged.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
